@startuml value-stream-process-boundary
' Source: CR-ES-003 §28 + §8 + §16 + §17 + ADR-ES-003 §8 + §16
' Title: Value Stream vs Process ;;; critical architectural boundary
' Captures: layered hierarchy (Value Stream -> Value Stage -> Process -> Activity -> Task -> Workflow)
'          and the 3 rejected alternatives from ADR-ES-003 §31
' Authored by: Emmanuel A. Otchere (cardinal author rule, 2026-09-23)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor<<value>>       #FFF4E8
  BackgroundColor<<stage>>       #FFE8D0
  BackgroundColor<<execution>>    #E8F4FF
  BackgroundColor<<implementation>> #F0F0F0
  BorderColor #333333
}

component "Value Stream" as vs <<value>>
component "Value Stage" as stage <<stage>>
component "Process" as proc <<execution>>
component "Activity" as act <<execution>>
component "Task" as task <<execution>>
component "Workflow / Task Flow" as wf <<execution>>
component "Service" as svc <<implementation>>
component "System" as sys <<implementation>>
component "Resource" as res <<implementation>>
component "Technology" as tech <<implementation>>

vs      -[#FF7F0E]-> stage   : "contains"
stage   -[#FF7F0E]-> proc    : "realized-through"
proc    -[#1F77B4]-> act     : "decomposes into"
act     -[#1F77B4]-> task    : "decomposes into"
task    -[#1F77B4]-> wf      : "coordinated by"

vs      -[#2CA02C]-> svc    : "uses"
vs      -[#2CA02C]-> sys    : "may involve"
vs      -[#2CA02C]-> res    : "uses-resource"

note top of vs
  VALUE REALIZATION layer
end note

note top of proc
  EXECUTION layer
end note

note bottom of svc
  IMPLEMENTATION layer
end note

note right of vs
  Per CR-ES-003 §8 + §16:
  Value Stream != Process hierarchy
  Value Stream is realized THROUGH Process
  ;;; not composed OF Process

  Per CR-ES-003 §17:
  Workflow is NOT the semantic
  representation of a Value Stream

  Per ADR-ES-003 §31 rejected alternatives:
  - Value Stream is-a Process (rejected)
  - Value Stream is-a Process Group (rejected)
  - Value Stream is-a Capability (rejected)
  - Value Stream is-a Service (rejected)
end note

@enduml
